Use your image generation tool to create exactly ONE image: a very wide landscape-format (1536x1024) panorama of an abstract terrazzo stone pattern of colorful chips on a warm off-white background. The scene must be horizontally continuous with no single central focal point, and its left and right edges must match so it tiles seamlessly as a looping horizontal panorama. Rich color with moderate contrast, no large pure-white areas (a translucent menu panel with text sits over most of it). No text, no frame, no border, no vignette, no watermark. Save the generated image into the current directory as terrazzo.png (copy it from wherever the tool writes it, do not resize or edit it). Print only the saved path. Do nothing else.
